ngCol]; } \\n            j+=dir;\\n        }\\n        mxSum = std::max(mxSum,sum);\\n    }\\n    printf(\\\"%d\\\\n\\\",mxSum);\\n}\\n\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"notes\": \"This transformation uses SIMD vectorization to process multiple elements in parallel and loop dependencies to optimize the algorithm.\",\n  \"research\": {\n    \"queries\": [\"SIMD vectorization techniques for C++\", \"Loop dependency analysis and optimization strategies\"],\n    \"urls\": [\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/SIMD\", \"https://www.openmp.org/specs/5.0/html/html-5.0.pdf\"]\n  }\n}"
